<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89645" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκόπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strike</i> one thing <i>against</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς λίθον τὸν πόδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ps.</u>
					90(91).12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸν δάκτυλόν που</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					275
				</span></i>
			 (lyr). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> intr.,
				<i>stumble</i> or <i>strike against</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				7.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				882b18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GC</u>
				326a27
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῷ ὀφθαλμῷ</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίζῃ κυάμου</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.8.8
			</span></i>; of liquid, <i>to be checked by striking against</i>, c.
			dat., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεῦμα προσκόπτον</span>
			<i>broken, interrupted</i> breathing, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				4.68
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῷ ἄξονι</span>
			<i>encounter friction at . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mech.</u>
				852a32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκρούω</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i>, <i>offend</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Posidipp.
				36
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς πολλοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.49.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μόνον δυσαρεστήσειν ἀλλὰ καὶ
				προσκόπτειν ἔμελλε προφανῶς</span>, of an open
			<i>breach</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.5.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>take offence at</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα μή μοι προσκόψῃς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					463.11
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ βαρύτητί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.31.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Carneisc.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1027.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὺς -κόψαντάς τισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					13.59
				</span></i>
			; of things, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῷ ζῆν</span>
			<i>to be disgusted with</i> life, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.61
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆμος π. αὐτῷ διά τι</span>
			<i>being offended with</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				2.27
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				9.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
